    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Moore Larkin are delighted to present to the market No.1 Cushla Downs, a beautifully modernised three-bedroom, semi-detached home, measuring 88 sq. m / 947 sq. feet approximately. This home is in a mature, highly regarded location and within easy reach of a wealth of amenities. The excellent A BER energy rating is a testament to the work and upgrades that this home has undergone with a new air to water heat pump system installed. The current owners have completely modernised and upgraded the property throughout, enjoying a warm welcoming atmosphere, oozing in style and character. \nThere is a sunny east / west aspect to the property with a private rear garden, a block-built store and a separate block built double garage which is also plumbed for utilities. Also, the property includes a large carport.\nThe accommodation in brief comprises of entrance hallway, living room to front and open plan kitchen/dining room with patio doors leading to the rear garden. Upstairs there are three bedrooms (master en-suite) and a modern family bathroom completes the accommodation.\nVIEWINGS ARE HIGHLY RECOMMENDED.\n"
      },
